        "text": "### **[0] Anthropic Releases Claude Haiku 5.5**\n* **Confirmed:** Anthropic officially launched Claude Haiku 5.5"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 238,
        "endIndex": 298,
        "text": "It features an adaptive thinking parameter (effort controls)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 238,
        "endIndex": 325,
        "text": "It features an adaptive thinking parameter (effort controls), a 1M token context window"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 238,
        "endIndex": 355,
        "text": "It features an adaptive thinking parameter (effort controls), a 1M token context window, and up to 128k output tokens"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 451,
        "endIndex": 489,
        "text": "75% cheaper on average than Haiku 4.5)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 491,
        "endIndex": 585,
        "text": "It is available across Anthropic’s API, AWS Bedrock, Google Cloud, Azure, and GitHub Copilot"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 587,
        "endIndex": 685,
        "text": "* **Caveats:** Pricing increases fivefold for requests exceeding 100k context tokens ($0.50/$2.50)"
