    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 919,
        "endIndex": 1245,
        "text": "### **[1] OpenAI Launches GPT-6 and Dynamic \"Intelligent UI\" in ChatGPT**\n* **Confirmed:** OpenAI announced the global rollout of GPT-6 models within ChatGPT accompanied by \"Intelligent UI,\" which dynamically generates interactive components (widgets, forms, calculators, charts, checklists) alongside streaming text responses"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
