    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1727,
        "endIndex": 2038,
        "text": "### **[13] Fired OpenAI Researchers Send Safety Governance Warning to Board**\n* **Confirmed:** Three recently terminated OpenAI researchers submitted a joint letter to the company’s board urging AI labs to halt capabilities research that degrades visibility into model reasoning or chain-of-thought monitoring"
