        "endIndex": 2834,
        "text": "### **[7] Unsealed Docs: NY Lawsuit Alleges TikTok Ran Non-Functional Safety \"Placebos\"**\n* **Confirmed:** Unsealed filings in New York State’s ongoing lawsuit against TikTok allege the platform conducted internal experiments giving thousands of users—including minors—placebo versions of safety controls that were non-functional when activated"
