        "endIndex": 3507,
        "text": "### **[2] Nvidia Pursued Last-Minute OpenRouter Acquisition Bid**\n* **Confirmed:** *The Information* reported that Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang considered making a last-minute acquisition offer for AI model marketplace OpenRouter in July 2026 before OpenRouter accepted an acquisition deal with Stripe (valued at ~$7B–$8B)"
