        "text": "### **[11] Robot Motion Data Startup Mecka AI Raises $60M Series B Led by Sequoia**\n* **Confirmed:** Toronto-based Mecka AI raised a $60M Series B round led by Sequoia Capital at a $500M valuation, with participation from Nvidia, Microsoft’s M12, Qualcomm Ventures, and Samsung"
